INSERT INTO feature VALUES('deployment-file','runtime','A deployment''s site and manifold, read as the flags they desugar to','migrate-wire','partial','notable',NULL,'A deployment is two gandr files of `std.manifold`. A site, `module Site : Model(Site)` exported packed as `pub def site : Model(Site)`, names the key its place proves, the sockets a dialer reaches it at and the name of the key''s secret, and `gandr host --site` binds them under the secret that name reads (secret-never-open), refusing a secret that proves another key, and prints its peer spelling on standard error once bound; a host given no world bindings hosts every world its entry may migrate to. A manifold, `module Manifold : Model(Manifold)` beside `pub def placements : List(Placement)`, names the program it deploys by its path and places each world at a site''s model, `At(name, site)` for one process and `Instances(name, site, count)` refused at any other count, and `gandr run --manifold` and `gandr host --manifold` take its world bindings, refusing a program it does not deploy. A flag given beside the file it desugars from is refused, naming both; the program named by address is owed (#6768).','surface-dispatcher surface-driver runtime-net','corpus/ledger/features/deployment-file.gandr corpus/model/worlds/two-processes.site.gandr corpus/model/worlds/two-processes.manifold.gandr crates/surface-dispatcher/tests/manifold.rs crates/surface-driver/tests/net.rs','corpus/ledger/features/deployment-file.gandr','#6768');
